s `{\"token\": ...}`; send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`), `GET /auth/me`, `POST /auth/logout`, and `GET/POST /todos`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /todos/{id}`. Validation errors answer 400 with `{\"error\": \"...\", \"errors\": {\"field\": \"message\"}}`.\n- Data is stored in SQLite at `./data/app.db` (override the directory with `DATA_DIR`).\n- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS (via `@tailwindcss/vite`); `npm run build` type-checks and builds to `frontend/dist`.\n- Local dev: run `gunicorn --pythonpath backend app:app --bind 127.0.0.1:8000` and `npm run dev` in `frontend/` (Vite proxies `/api`).\nEOF\ngit status --short","time":{"start":1794253749863,"end":1794253749885}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1db7e5f001VAm2ph75OHMZHN","sessionID":"ses_e3e2c8327ffeEdHEddppyRWgly","messageID":"msg_1c1db5b1b001vCdirO9k7q1BS3"}}
